        "content": "CK2. Suggest names to my councillors. Something not long, not importantly real ir serious. That I immediately understand persons specialisation. I have no imagination, so I valled them Diplo, Marty, Stew, Intri, Learn (he's chaplain and physician), plus commanders Left (speed of army), Center (damage against different faith), Right (siege speed). And wife - Wifey. (but don't make all of them end with \"y\" in a silly childish manner)",
